  "details": "This problem first started appearing in november but has gotten much worse over time. Attached graphs show the tracked amount of online users. `online min 1min` dropping down usually also means that most or all users drop off the online friends list, which sometimes also breaks the online friends list in a way that only a restart of VRChat fixes it again. The 1st percentile graph shows very well that this problem has gotten much worse in the last days.",
